@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@invoiceId = 244045
@invoiceNumber = 0007069

### Entrada inicial: primer documento elegible de Facturación
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/invoices/first

### Cargar una factura directamente por número
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/invoices/by-number/{{invoiceNumber}}

### Buscador general
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/invoices?q={{invoiceNumber}}&page=1&pageSize=25

### Buscador OMNIS: los criterios son opcionales y combinables
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/invoices?invoiceNumber={{invoiceNumber}}&orderNumber=P015471&customerOrderNumber=TELEFONICO&customerCode=007569&issuedAt=2023-03-21&page=1&pageSize=100

### Cargar encabezado, partidas y totales
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/invoices/{{invoiceId}}

### Barra compartida: anterior
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/invoices/{{invoiceId}}/previous

### Barra compartida: siguiente
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/invoices/{{invoiceId}}/next

### Acciones: Auxiliar
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/invoices/{{invoiceId}}/actions/auxiliary

### Acciones: Cajas / Empaque
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/invoices/{{invoiceId}}/actions/boxes

### Acciones: Clasifica
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/invoices/{{invoiceId}}/actions/classifications

### Acciones: Comentarios
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/invoices/{{invoiceId}}/actions/comments

### Acciones: CT
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/invoices/{{invoiceId}}/actions/ct

### Acciones: Imprimir (opciones, no imprime)
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/invoices/{{invoiceId}}/actions/print

### Acciones: Lotes
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/invoices/{{invoiceId}}/actions/lots

### Acciones: Piezas
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/invoices/{{invoiceId}}/actions/pieces

### Acciones: Sellar (estado, no sella)
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/invoices/{{invoiceId}}/actions/seal

### Sumarios: Tiket > Factura (solo contexto de lectura)
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/invoices/{{invoiceId}}/summaries/ticket-to-invoice

### Sumarios: Traspaso (solo partidas; no modifica inventario)
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/invoices/{{invoiceId}}/summaries/transfer

### Sumarios: Edita pzas (solo lectura)
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/invoices/{{invoiceId}}/summaries/edit-pieces

### Sumarios: Liquidación camión (solo lectura)
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/invoices/{{invoiceId}}/summaries/truck-settlement
